# MANDATORY: TRANSOVO MCTB PAGE INVENTORY & ROUTE MANIFEST

**Source of truth:** `docs/TRANSOVO-MCTB-PAGE-INVENTORY-AND-ROUTE-MANIFEST.md`  
**Prerequisites:** product scope → IA navigation map (`.cursor/rules/transovo-mctb-product-scope.mdc`, `transovo-mctb-ia-navigation.mdc`)  
**Applies with:** `transovo-mctb-canonical.mdc`, `transovo-mctb-page-build-specs.mdc`, all `transovo-*.mdc` standards (always).

## When this rule activates

**Before implementing, rebuilding, or declaring complete** any MCTB page, route, section, state, or cross-link — read product scope and IA map first, then **this manifest**.

Paths: `src/app/**/mctb/**`, `src/app/**/voice/**`, `src/components/mctb/**`, `src/app/(app)/onboarding/mctb/**`, `src/app/f/mctb/**`.

## Authority order (MCTB)

1. Product scope — what MCTB is / is not
2. IA & navigation map — where everything lives
3. **This manifest — completeness** (every route, page, section, state, legacy migration)
4. Canonical product map — domain model, lifecycle
5. Page build specs — screen implementation (`docs/TRANSOVO-MCTB-PAGE-BUILD-SPECS.md`)
6. Transovo standards
7. Existing code/screenshots — evidence only

## Hard requirements

1. **Account for every route** in the manifest before declaring MCTB frontend rebuild complete.
2. **Six route categories:** operational | configuration | compliance/audit | temporary process | public/customer | admin/support.
3. **Do not silently omit** working functionality, states, controls, or workflows already in scope.
4. **No mock controls or analytics** — real runtime or explicitly unavailable.
5. **Shared shell** on authenticated pages; public/onboarding/admin exceptions only.
6. **Number labels:** Business line | Forwarding destination | Text-back sender.
7. **Press-1 vs existing-consent** — correct UI per mode; system compliance message ≠ conversational recovery message.
8. **Legacy `/voice/*`** — redirect/merge/retire per migration matrix; no orphan routes.
9. **System states per page:** normal, loading, empty, filtered empty, error, partial/degraded, permission-blocked where applicable.
10. **Cross-links, deep links, return context** — required per manifest §45–47.
11. **Reuse canonical engines** — no frontend-only duplicate business logic.

## Required route inventory (minimum)

**Operational:** `/mctb`, `/mctb/missed-calls[/:id]`, `/mctb/conversations[/:id]`, `/mctb/analytics`, optional `/mctb/voicemail`

**Configuration:** `/mctb/setup[/phone|messaging|consent|schedule|voicemail|exclusions|test]`

**Compliance:** `/mctb/compliance[/consent]`

**Process:** `/onboarding/mctb`

**Public:** `/f/mctb/:token`

