## Build order

Appointment visual refs → shared shell/tokens → MCTB nav config → routes → operational pages → setup → compliance → onboarding/public → legacy redirects → integration → responsive/a11y QA.

## Governing sentence

**IA map says where; this manifest says what must exist.** No page is complete without route, runtime, states, cross-links, and legacy decision documented.
